WEBVTT

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:06.800
When we step out into the street, it will feel like running away from home.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.200
We have all the roads of the world waiting for us.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.600
We want to make up for lost time and start building the future again.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.000
Introducing Planeta Zero,

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:36.800
a space where everyone is welcome and invited to be part of the change.

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:44.600
Where you can explore sustainability content and decide whether you want to join this movement,

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:47.200
leaving your mark on history.

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:52.500
The first step is getting to know the planet, the programme,

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:55.400
the prizes, the partners,

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:58.800
in a clear narrative that encourages you to start.

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:08.000
We want to tell the story we are writing: the programme's impact,

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:13.600
the pillars that guide us, our mission and our goals, together.

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:20.800
This story is made of many stories, and we know it's important to lift the veil

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:26.200
so that those who haven't joined yet also feel like changing the world.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:42.600
Every initiative, every action, every click creates the future we dream of for us and our children.

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:47.600
That's why the Planeta Zero movement is here to stay.

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:56.600
We imagined this journey in detail

00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:58.300
and we're eager to make it together.

00:01:58.300 --> 00:01:59.800
Shall we?
